8. Compliance and Termination

Your rights under this license terminate automatically if You violate its
terms. If this is Your first violation and You fully correct it within 30 days
after receiving written notice from the Licensor, Your rights are reinstated
as of the date the violation is corrected. Repeated violations terminate Your
rights permanently unless the Licensor agrees otherwise in writing.

Sections 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 9, 10, and 11 survive termination to the extent needed
to give them effect. Termination does not cancel royalties or reports already
due.

